---
date: 2026-06-25
title: A fresh look and a smoother practice flow
summary: Meet the new AnimoRank look, browse comfortably on mobile, and enjoy a more reliable code workspace.
---

**Added**

- A new AnimoRank logo and favicon across the app.

**Improved**

- Browsing, problem sets, and the rest of the site now adapt to phones and
  tablets. (The code editor and practice workspace still need a larger screen.)
- The code editor and practice workspace got a redesigned theme that's easier
  on the eyes during long sessions.
- Clicking the logo in the navbar now takes you home.

**Fixed**

- The loading spinner no longer lingers after a submission goes through.
- Test cases now run and report individually, so a single failure won't hide
  the rest of your results.
- Sorted out a problem with character output not printing correctly.
